#: ../../resources_page.rst:282
msgid "Subwindow Organizer"
msgstr "Subwindow Organizer - 子窗口管理器"

#: ../../resources_page.rst:284
msgid ""
"Helps with handling multiple documents in subwindow mode. Introduces "
"responsive fullscreen with other subwindows opened, dynamic snapping of "
"subwindows to canvas borders, drag and drop switching between subwindows, "
"and more."
msgstr ""
"此插件可以在子窗口模式下打开多个图像时提供一些视图辅助功能。它可以在其他子窗"
"口打开时进行自适应全屏显示、将子窗口动态吸附到画布视图边框、拖放内容时跟随切"
"换活动子窗口，以及更多其他功能。"

#: ../../resources_page.rst:286
